{title: Ta amo Dios}
{artist: Ben Fielding, Brian Johnson, Jenn Johnson, Ed Cash, Jason Ingram}
{key: Ab}

{comment: Verso 1}
[Ab]Te amo Dios,
Tu [Db]amor nunca me [Ab]falla,
